---
// A label above the first role that is not on the resume. Hidden until the page is opened through the
// resume link (see revealEarlier in TimelineList.astro). It spans the full row, logo column included, and
// lines up with the edges of the highlighted boxes below it (they reach 12px beyond the row).
---

<li data-earlier-divider hidden class="-mx-3 flex items-center gap-3 pb-5 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-neutral-700" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span>Not on the resume</span>
  <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-neutral-700" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</li>
